---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const locale = 'en';
const updated = 'August 31, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Skala Convert"
  description="How Skala Convert handles data, cookies and advertising."
  locale={locale}
  alternates={[]}
>
  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="hero"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div>

    <section class="block legal">
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        Every conversion on this site runs in your browser. The numbers you type are
        never sent to us, stored, or logged. There are no accounts, no sign-up, and no
        database of visitors.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do collect anonymous usage statistics, and we show advertising. Both are
        described below.
      </p>

      <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
      <p>
        If you switch between the light and dark theme, that choice is saved in your
        browser's local storage so the site opens the way you left it. It never leaves
        your device, and you can clear it at any time through your browser settings.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you convert a value, the number appears in the page address (for example
        <code>?v=100</code>) so the link can be shared. That happens entirely in your
        browser. We only see it if you choose to send the link to someone.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics to understand which converters people use and where the
        site is slow. It records the pages visited, approximate location at country or
        region level, and the type of device. We do not use it to identify individual
        people.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site is funded by advertising served through Google AdSense. Google and its
        partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and
        other websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can opt out of personalised advertising in
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google's Ads Settings</a>,
        or opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies at
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices in the EU and UK</h2>
      <p>
        On your first visit you are asked whether you consent to cookies used for
        advertising and analytics. Nothing that requires consent runs before you answer,
        and declining does not restrict your use of the converters.
      </p>
      <p>
        Where the GDPR applies, our legal basis for analytics and personalised
        advertising is your consent, which you can withdraw at any time by reopening the
        cookie settings or clearing this site's cookies in your browser.
      </p>
      <p>
        You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal
        data we hold about you. In practice we hold none: we operate no accounts and
        store no visitor records. Requests about data held by Google should be directed
        to Google, whose privacy policy is at
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a general-purpose tool and is not directed at children. We do not
        knowingly collect personal information from anyone.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top of this page changes with it.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy:
        <a href="mailto:contact@skalaconvert.com">contact@skalaconvert.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: var(--measure); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-2); }
  .legal p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .legal a { color: var(--accent); }
  .legal code { font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: .9em; }
  .updated { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .875rem; }
</style>
